      <description><![CDATA[
        India&#39;s indigenous Pralay quasi-ballistic missile just aced its latest user trial off Odisha coast. Here is why this sub-strategic asset fundamentally alters conventional deterrence along the Line of Actual Control.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The quasi-ballistic trajectory and advanced maneuvering capabilities allow Pralay to evade modern integrated air defense systems.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The weapon system directly supports the Atmanirbhar Bharat mandate, reducing foreign dependence for critical high-precision tactical strike assets.
        [SPLIT]
